@AGENTS.md

The project rules for every agent are in **`AGENTS.md`** at the root of
**`~/dev/projects/___PROJECT___/`**, next to this file. The line above imports
them. If that import did not load (Claude Code asks for approval when a session
starts in a task checkout below this directory), read that **`AGENTS.md`** now
and follow it. Edit the rules there, not in this file.

Further reading: `docs/project-task-workspaces.md` in your dotfiles repository.
